       <p>Elimination is a logical deduction technique used in Akari (also known as Light Up) puzzles when basic rules alone cannot make progress. Instead of proving where a light bulb <em>must</em> go, you prove where it <em>cannot</em> go by assuming the opposite and watching for a contradiction.</p>
